              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <div class="flex text-amber-500 mb-3.5">
            {
              Array.from({ length: 5 }).map(() => (
                <svg
                  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                  class="w-4 h-4 fill-current mr-0.5"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                  <path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z" />
                </svg>
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <p
            class="text-sm font-sans font-light leading-relaxed text-cafe-text text-left"
          >
            "Everything about Cafe is pure perfection. I had a flat white and
            their sourdough almond croissant. The espresso extraction was
            balanced and rich, and the milk texture was silky smooth. The cozy
            velvet chairs and abundance of plants make it so welcoming."
          </p>
        </div>

        <span
          class="text-xs text-cafe-text/40 font-sans tracking-wide text-left mt-6 block"
