            "As an amateur barista, I'm incredibly picky about espresso. Cafe's
            consistency is amazing. Clean, sweet crema, no bitter notes, and
            milk texture microfoamed to absolute perfection. Their commitment to
            ethical, direct-trade sourcing shines through."
          </p>
        </div>

        <span
          class="text-xs text-cafe-text/40 font-sans tracking-wide text-left mt-6 block"
          >Reviewed 1 month ago</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
